flowchart LR
  U[Employee / Technician / Admin] --> UI[React + TypeScript SPA]
  UI -->|HTTPS REST + JWT| API[Spring Boot Controllers]
  API --> SEC[Spring Security / JWT]
  API --> SVC[Domain Services]
  SVC --> STR[Priority & Assignment Strategies]
  SVC --> STATE[Incident Lifecycle States]
  SVC --> REPO[Repositories: JPA + JDBC]
  SVC --> EVT[Application Events]
  EVT --> AUD[Audit / Notification Listeners]
  EVT --> MAIL[Simulated Email After Commit]
  SCH[SLA & Retry Schedulers] --> SVC
  REPO --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  AUD --> DB
  MAIL --> DB
